WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.143
Today we will coordinate movement with music. Our work connects with selected artists

00:00:05.143 --> 00:00:06.664
and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:12.541
Choose two safe steps that suit the chosen rhythm. Name a design choice that a

00:00:12.541 --> 00:00:14.211
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:17.764
Connect them with a pause and a change of direction.

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:22.468
Perform the phrase twice with control and enough personal space.
